  <NOTES 0 0
  |ICST HOA Reaper Session Starter v2
  |
  |Open this project directly in REAPER.
  |
  |Track plan
  |- 00 NOTES: setup reminder
  |- 10-13 SRC: source tracks for encoder inserts
  |- 20 HOA BUS: central 64ch ambisonics bus
  |- 30 DECODER MAIN: loudspeaker decoder track
  |- 40 BINAURAL CHECK: optional headphone monitor path
  |- 90 PRINT / EXPORT: optional render capture or print stem
  |
  |Recommended setup order
  |1. Check audio device and sample rate.
  |2. Insert ICST MonoEncoder or MultiEncoder on SRC tracks.
  |3. Route each encoded SRC track to HOA BUS.
  |4. Insert ICST Decoder on DECODER MAIN and load the speaker preset.
  |5. Optionally feed BINAURAL CHECK from HOA BUS for headphone control.
  |6. Keep accidental source-to-master paths disabled.
  |
  |Verification
  |- Master, HOA BUS, DECODER MAIN, BINAURAL CHECK and SRC tracks should stay at 64 channels.
  |- Test with one mono source first.
  |- Confirm movement in the decoder and on the actual loudspeaker layout.
  >
